Drafting
Drafting occurs when two or more moving vehicles or individ
uals align closely to reduce the overall effect of drag. Drafting
is seen in competitive events such as auto racing, bicycle racing,
speed-skating, and running.
Studies show that air flow over a single vehicle or individ
